title: Authorizations › Queue › Sites: what each viewer sees
route: /authorizations
intro: How the queue follows the viewer and the site switch in the top bar. Every row, band, figure, the sidebar badge and the payer-signal count are worked out from the requests at the sites in view, so Site A plus Site B is Both sites. A viewer who may see one site never sees, counts, searches or links to the other site's requests.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the site of a request is fixed by the demo (the case ID decides, see src/data/sites.ts) and the viewer is chosen in the Demo menu under 'Viewing as'. A fresh load always starts as Jordan Perez on Both sites. In today's demo data the 56 open requests are 36 at Site A and 20 at Site B.
---
start s1 "Open the queue"
start s2 "Demo menu › 'Viewing as' › pick a viewer"
screen q "Authorizations queue"
decision dV "How many sites may the viewer see?"
process v1 "Two: Jordan Perez (UR coordinator) or Alex Morgan (clinic owner)"
process v2 "One: Dr. Rivera sees Site A only, Sam Okafor sees Site B only"
screen sw "Top bar switch\n'Both sites', 'Site A', 'Site B'"
screen lk "Top bar shows a locked 'Site A only' (or 'Site B only')\nThere is no 'Both sites' to pick"
click c1 "Click 'Both sites', 'Site A' or 'Site B'"
store sc "The sites in view are kept for the session\nA new viewer starts on their only site, or on Both sites"

process p1 "The page keeps only the open requests at the sites in view\nEverything below is worked out from them"
screen h1 "Header names the site when one site is in view\n'12 of 36 open requests at Site A need action today.'\nBoth sites: no site in the header"
screen bd "Band cards and their counts, the rows, the four figures\nthe average approval chance and 'next due in ...'"
process sb "Sidebar badge on 'Authorizations'\nAct now plus Due within 24 hours at the sites in view"
process sg "Payer signal\nCounts the affected requests in view\nOne affected: 'Review it'. Site A has one, Site B three"
process fl "Search, every filter, the figures and ?quick= reach only requests in view\nA request at the other site is not found, not counted and does not open"
doc eq "Totals: Both sites = Site A + Site B\nOpen, Act now, Due within 24 hours, Due this week, Waiting on you, the badge and the signal count all add up\n(An average does not add: it is worked out again)"

click l1 "Open a request at the other site by its address\n/authorizations/case/ID"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › A case at another site"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Queue › Open the queue and read the top"
goto g3 "Continues in: Authorizations › Queue › Quick view panel"

s1 --> q
s2 --> sc
q --> dV
dV -->|Two| v1 --> sw --> c1 --> sc
dV -->|One| v2 --> lk
sc --> p1
lk --> p1
p1 --> h1
p1 --> bd
p1 --> sb
p1 --> sg
p1 --> fl
bd -.-> eq
sb -.-> eq
sg -.-> eq
fl --> l1 --> g1
h1 --> g2
fl --> g3
